# commit. Do not hand-edit the rendered requirements.txt.
#
# gradio and spaces are NOT listed: Hugging Face installs gradio at the
# sdk_version in README.md, and spaces alongside it on ZeroGPU hardware.
#
# MODEL RUNTIME — identical to docker/requirements-hermes.txt, and to the
# versions recorded in the kleos-v006-mistralnemo12b-run1 manifest. These
# decide tokenization, quantized arithmetic and generation, i.e. whether the
# served model is the model that was measured. Do not float them.
