# torch is the exact CUDA 12.8 wheel the research run and the Docker image use,
# by URL and hash rather than through an extra index, so every other package
# still resolves from PyPI. It needs Python 3.12 on x86_64 (README.md sets
# python_version). bitsandbytes 0.50.2 loads its CUDA 12.8 library, which
# includes Blackwell (sm_120) kernels.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

